# OpenPOS Desktop environment template
#
# The OpenPOS HTTP API is required for authentication, password recovery,
# product images, and administration. Packaged installs set `apiUrl` in
# Electron userData config.json. Keep secrets out of public desktop release artifacts.
# Required for the web/browser build. Packaged desktop reads apiUrl from config.json.
# Leave empty for same-origin `/api` requests in local web development only.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.example.com
